<title>USA: Tekelec gets Bell Atlantic deal.</title>
<headline>Tekelec gets Bell Atlantic deal.</headline>
<dateline>MORRISVILLE, N.C. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tekelec said Friday it has a multi-year agreement to supply Bell Atlantic Corp with its Eagle signal transporter systems, Eagle local number portability and Tekelec local service management system solutions.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Allan Toomer, Tekelec president said, &quot;Tekelec and its solutions will play an integral role in Bell Atlantic's Intelligent Network strategy and we are looking forward to furthering this new relationship.&quot;</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
